[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Jobava London System"]
[Variation "Against 3...c5"]
[ECO "A46"]
[Character "sharp"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "fork"]
[Themes "c7-pressure"]

1. d4 d5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Bf4 c5
4. e3 { Opens the bishop on f1 and keeps d4 supported before Black trades on it. } 4... cxd4
5. exd4 { Keeps the centre pawn on d4, and the e-file opens for the rooks later. } 5... e6
( 5... Nc6 6. Nb5 { Threatens Nc7+ again, forking king and rook. } 6... a6? { Attacks the knight but ignores c7. } 7. Nc7+ Qxc7 8. Bxc7 )
6. Nf3 { Develops and guards d4. } 6... Bd6
7. Bxd6 { Trades bishops now, on White's terms, instead of waiting for ...Bxf4. } 7... Qxd6
8. Bd3 { Aims at the kingside and clears the way for castling. } 8... O-O 9. O-O Nc6
10. Re1 { The rook takes the open e-file, where Black's e6 pawn is a target. } *
